Virtual Cell Research — independently maintained by Aper AI contributors.

This project maintains its own workflow, case catalogue, data inspection tools,
observed-response tutorials, documentation and verification process. It does not
require an upstream Skill service or checkout at runtime.

Included third-party material:
Some model adapters, result utilities, reference documents and historical
examples were imported from Pengzhi-Gao/aivc-skill and are maintained here.
